-foreground ml-1\">shared your post</span>\n                            </p>\n                        </div>\n                        <p className=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground bg-muted p-2 rounded border-l-2 border-primary\">\n                            UI/UX Best Practices for 2024\n                        </p>\n                        <p className=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground\">1 hour ago</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </Card>\n    )\n}\n",
